Step 1: Build "My Teams"
This endpoint returns only the teams created by the logged-in user.
GET /api/teams/my-teams
Flow:
Frontend
     │
GET /my-teams
     │
Authorization: Bearer token
     │
verifyToken
     │
req.user.userId
     │
Controller
     │
Service
     │
MongoDB

Step 3: Controller
Create a new controller function.
Responsibilities:
1. Read logged in user's id
const ownerId = req.user.userId
2. Call service
3. Return response

Exactly like your Register controller.